<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="Yash Chavda’s side projects, experiments."/><meta name="theme-color" content="#f8f0e2"/><title>Experiments — Yash Chavda</title></head><body class="work-page"><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><Header current="experiments" /><main id="main"><section class="section extras" id="beyond-work"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-top"><span class="section-label">01 / THINGS I BUILD</span><span class="section-label">ALWAYS CURIOUS</span></div><div class="extras-grid"><div><p class="script">beyond</p><h1>THE DAY JOB<span class="red">.</span></h1><p class="section-lead">I like shipping small, real things — and experimenting with where quality engineering goes next.</p><div class="project"><small>01 / SIDE PROJECT</small><h3>PROJECT POCKET</h3><p>A local-first iPhone app for planning personal projects, budgets, expenses, tasks and photos. Plan a project and keep its tasks and spending together on your device.</p></div><div class="project"><small>02 / EXPERIMENTS</small><h3>AGENTIC QA LAB</h3><p>MCP-led workflows connecting requirements, test generation, execution and Xray / Jira evidence. The workflow connects a requirement to generated tests, their execution and linked evidence.</p></div></div></div><a class="section-next" href="#contact" aria-label="Continue to footer"><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></section>
<ContactFooter backHref="#main" /></main></body></html>